{"text": "I prioritised **floods/waterlogging** and **commercial/structural fires** as the primary calamities due to their recurring nature, recency (e.g., Cyclone Michaung subway closures in 2023, 2021/2015 major floods, and multiple high-density fires across Ranganathan Street, Usman Road, and Pondy Bazaar), and severe impact on this densely built commercial hub (99.5% built cover). \n\nTo evaluate readiness:\n- For **floods**, I checked physical exposure via `get_flood_exposure`, flood refuge availability via `get_access('flood_refuge')`, and urban land cover changes using `get_nature_change` (revealing 36 flood-prone blocks affecting over 96,000 residents and 15 vulnerable schools near subways).\n- For **fires and industrial safety**, I assessed emergency response coverage using `get_access('fire_station')`, emergency medical access via `get_access('hospital')`, and chemical exposure risk through `get_industrial_exposure` (finding median fire station walk distance to be ~1.37 km and 37 industrial/storage sites within 4.2 km).\n- For **animals and overall readiness**, I analyzed baseline infrastructure via `get_area_profile` and veterinary access using `get_animal_facilities` (noting a major gap with 0 veterinary clinics or shelters within walking distance).", "tool_calls": [{"name": "get_area_profile", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_flood_exposure", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_nature_change", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_access", "args": {"kind": "flood_refuge"}}, {"name": "get_access", "args": {"kind": "fire_station"}}, {"name": "get_access", "args": {"kind": "hospital"}}, {"name": "get_animal_facilities", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_industrial_exposure", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_area_profile", "response": {"area": "T. Nagar", "centre": [13.0418, 80.2341], "radius_m": 1500, "blocks": 77, "blocks_with_satellite_data": 77, "residents_estimate": 207439, "residents_source": "WorldPop 2020 (modelled estimate)", "trees_share_2016_pct": 0.8, "trees_share_2025_pct": 0.2, "wa